# Privacy & Architecture Rules (NON-NEGOTIABLE)

## Data Handling

- NEVER send media files to any server
- NEVER send transcripts or audio data to external APIs
- NEVER introduce backend dependencies for transcription
- NEVER add analytics that transmit user content
- All processing MUST remain 100% client-side

## Network Usage

- Model downloads from CDN are allowed (Hugging Face, jsDelivr)
- FFmpeg.wasm core downloads are allowed
- NO other network calls during processing
- Verify with: Network tab should show zero requests during transcription

## Storage

- IndexedDB for model caching: allowed
- LocalStorage for user preferences: allowed
- No cookies for tracking
- No external database connections

## Verification

Before any PR that touches audio/transcription code:
1. Open DevTools → Network tab
2. Run a transcription
3. Confirm NO requests made during processing (only during initial model load)
